Subject: [PATCH] add eeprom

---
 hw/arm/Kconfig        |  3 +++
 hw/arm/virt.c         | 54 +++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++
 include/hw/arm/virt.h |  1 +
 3 files changed, 58 insertions(+)

diff --git a/hw/arm/Kconfig b/hw/arm/Kconfig
